      "marks": 4,
      "question": "<strong>Case Study:</strong> A person writes a letter to 4 of his friends. He asks each one of them to copy the letter and mail to 4 different persons with instruction that they move the chain similarly. Assuming that the chain is not broken and that it costs 50 paise to mail one letter.<br>(i) How many letters are mailed in the 1st set?<br>(ii) How many letters are mailed in the 2nd set?<br>(iii) Find the total cost for the first 5 sets.",
