      "solutionSteps": [
        "(i) 1st set: 4 letters.",
        "(ii) 2nd set: $4 \\times 4 = 16$ letters.",
        "(iii) Total letters = $4 + 16 + 64 + 256 + 1024$. This is a GP with $a=4, r=4, n=5$.",
        "$S_5 = \\frac{4(4^5-1)}{4-1} = \\frac{4(1023)}{3} = 1364$.",
        "Cost = $1364 \\times 0.50$ Rs = ₹682."
